  <!--
    Generate the Windows App SDK C++/WinRT projection headers (winrt/Microsoft.Windows.*.h)
    from the AppSDK metadata winmds using the Windows SDK cppwinrt.exe. This matches the
    version of the SDK's prebuilt winrt/base.h so the static_assert version guard passes.
